{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6a60c5ee49f5b5837fae0849b4f65fdb0e0b27e0887f4e70a1928b29bdead0ed", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影は順調に進み\n星梨花もパジャマ姿で休憩中だ）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄顺利进行着，\n星梨花也穿着睡衣休息中。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "acb9da7bcf748e39c267f491790d7cc29ead061d2e2a2767a3a3ab598e91f94f", "ja": "{$P$}さん。今日の撮影、\n外で撮るかもしれなかったって知ってましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。您知道今天的拍摄，\n原本可能要在室外取景吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1abba8520b6564f662225915d037879da3b015f017329623dc82787ecebbb549", "ja": "ああ。そういう撮影プランもあったみたいだな。\n色々検討して、今日の形になったそうだ。", "zh": "啊。好像确实有过那种在外面拍摄的方案。\n听说经过多方面考虑，最后才定成了今天这样的形式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "c2d99b7706e1ae9b6696fdb7bb45b80c6fd4c5cfbb3524d690578d37b37e4bd0", "ja": "そうだったんですね。スタッフさんに教えてもらったん\nですけど、わたし、びっくりしちゃいました。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。工作人员告诉我之后，我都吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "b29971d9a6b86f16a4989835d685e94cb658e72ddf172405c394ba29cf479590", "ja": "パジャマでお外に出るなんて、\n考えたこともなかったから。", "zh": "因为我从没想过要穿着睡衣出门。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7f9bc6d785fa3e30e72a59b254d38672c1c2a823089c2375dd5dde52e4e1cbc0", "ja": "確かに。\n普段は、家の中で着ることが多いもんな。", "zh": "确实。\n平时大多是在家里穿的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "00587a4e33f92ae504d78900749c8ed29bd9e58dd12b2234fb557d74dbcb9b0c", "ja": "はい。おうちでそんなことしたら、\nきっと、パパやママに怒られちゃいます。", "zh": "是的。要是在家里做那种事，\n爸爸和妈妈肯定会生气的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "aefa13f91dc2dd3f99e23ed98cb6f7dfc86db6a7ee3bd037c8fe89d194ec730c", "ja": "でも、このパジャマはかわいいから。\nちょっとお出かけしてみたいなって。", "zh": "不过，这件睡衣很可爱嘛。\n所以我想，要不要穿着它出门逛逛呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3746f89eb0d82e56028aeaa37857aad2bccdef936964b132068a606fb8d42a2a", "ja": "ははっ。お行儀は悪いかもしれないけど、\nだからこそ、夢は広がるな。", "zh": "哈哈，虽然这样可能有点不太规矩，\n但正因如此，梦想才更丰富多彩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "dc2a8a2a83a109e9fbd5a50c4b7e589ae15be0446a6d04bc5038f0fea7f36e1f", "ja": "はい。パジャマのまま、ジュニオールとお散歩したり、\nお買い物に行ったり……。", "zh": "是的。就这样穿着睡衣，和Junior一起散散步，或者去买东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "d2f6297cf2e7b38bcc31e92e491c5c9c660b04fc29567fcfdfd22075866f4375", "ja": "本当はしちゃいけないことですけど……\n考えただけで、なんだかドキドキしてきました。", "zh": "其实是不能这么做的……\n可光是想想，就让我有点心跳加速了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d20a9689c17effb623252b684deb1b696ce5f24df345a3f73f66c008c2999d7c", "ja": "それは……罪悪感で楽しむどころじゃないかもな。\nうーん、ここにジュニオールはいないけど……。", "zh": "那样的话……可能会因为罪恶感，根本没法享受吧。\n嗯——虽然朱尼奥尔不在这里，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5f24ceaf50211f5ebc8d3c0a873731ee523cb1b066dc20762d063687ba307f12", "ja": "スタジオの外を散歩するくらいなら大丈夫だと思う。\nどうする、星梨花？", "zh": "我觉得，只是在摄影棚外面散散步，应该没问题。\n星梨花，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "b7f3e44e114186de5373adc4bc2c30ab25df9d06beb1fa78c6feb337fd5d85c4", "ja": "本当ですか！　わたし、行ってみたいです！", "zh": "真的吗！我想去看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e77e28bf089a1675bfefeb92576220c394fd47119b859e181629f26c99840dd3", "ja": "うん。本番までには戻ってこよう。\nそれじゃ行こうか。", "zh": "嗯。正式演出前要回来。\n那我们走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0553_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "ccf3f4e64ca9a5ff5995c3dc966fa9133baae57ef6c9ab5743de1d59f455f904", "ja": "はい！　あっ。パジャマでお外に出たこと……\nパパやママには秘密にしてくださいね？", "zh": "好的！啊，对了……我穿着睡衣出门这件事……\n请替我向爸爸妈妈保密哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
